flowchart LR
    Q[Question text] --> API[POST /api/ask]
    API --> CAT[Category]
    API --> RET[Retrieved policy sections]
    CAT --> PROMPT[Selected prompt + evidence]
    RET --> PROMPT
    PROMPT --> MODE{Execution mode}
    MODE -- Gemini configured --> MODEL[Gemini JSON]
    MODE -- No key --> DEMO[Deterministic lookup]
    MODEL --> VALIDATE[Validate schema, source, section, exact quote, answer]
    DEMO --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE -->|verified| OUT[Answer with citation and confidence]
    VALIDATE -->|not verified| GAP[Uncertainty response, no citation]
    OUT --> UI[Chat UI]
    GAP --> UI
